Embedded FIGlet fonts
---------------------
Standard (default): Glenn Chappell and Ian Chai, March 1993, based on Frank's
signature; Latin extensions by John Cowan; layout update by Paul Burton.
Small (compact): Glenn Chappell, April 1993, based on Standard; layout update
by Paul Burton.

The unmodified standard.flf and small.flf files are vendored from the
figlet-rs 1.0.0 distribution (https://crates.io/crates/figlet-rs/1.0.0).
Original project: https://github.com/cmatsuoka/figlet (BSD-3-Clause).
Copyright notices and licence terms are reproduced in
crates/squad-core/src/banner/fonts/LICENSE-FIGlet.txt and the font headers.
Their embedded permission to modify requires the modifier's name in a comment.
These third-party assets retain their original terms.
